# Keep the Docker build context small and reproducible: only Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock/src +
# rust-toolchain.toml, plus examples/ (the extension probe) and packaging/extensions/ (the fetch
# and check scripts), are needed by the build stage (see Dockerfile). Everything else is noise.
/target
/share
.git
.github
.agents
.claude
spec
doc
tests
*.md
build.sh
install.sh
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.gitignore
